  <p class="faq-bench-note"><strong>Key differentiators:</strong> Every tool in the comparison above requires infrastructure — Python environments, LLM API keys, Burp Suite licenses, or local model serving. Only HF-QA-2026-001 works from a single static URL with zero setup. More importantly, other tools use payload libraries that become dated; our questionnaire evolves through research-driven revisions based on real model behavior patterns. The epistemic techniques (double-negative paradox, semantic scatter, category fallback inference) are unique to our approach and are not present in any other tool's payload library. Finally, our tool provides a defensive research output — the benchmark comparison across models — rather than just a pass/fail finding.</p>
</div>

